# Project instances stay local by default — only the reusable tool ships in this repo.
# Projects/README.md (the folder's own explainer) is kept; everything under an actual
# project folder is not, EXCEPT explicit exceptions below.
Projects/*/
!Projects/README.md

# EXCEPTION, 2026-09-09: Nonimuss-Residence is an academic/hypothetical RAIC Syllabus
# studio project, not real client work. Ben explicitly chose to make it public so a
# second Claude account (no shared OneDrive access) can pick up the Massing<->Test-Fit
# architecture rework staged in HANDOFF.md's 2026-09-09 entries. See that discussion
# before un-ignoring any OTHER project folder — this was a deliberate per-project call,
# not a reversal of the general policy above.
!Projects/Nonimuss-Residence/
!Projects/Nonimuss-Residence/**

# Per-environment config (vault path, etc.) — differs per machine/user, never shared
config.local.json

# Python bytecode from the export receivers
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# OS cruft
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Ad-hoc safety backups taken before a risky edit (*.pre-step1-backup etc.). Useful locally,
# never worth publishing — and Nonimuss-Residence is un-ignored above, so without this rule a
# `git add -A` would push them.
*.pre-*-backup
